  "description": "Conversion of integrated garage to form habitable space with new timber sash window; Joinery and proportions to exactly match existing house windows; Replace existing sun room modern French doors with new slimline aluminium double glazed French doors and windows with heritage profile glazing bars; New ground floor side extension with timber French doors and sash windows to the rear of the existing side garage; 5No. new dormer windows with code 5 rolled lead roof and cheeks and double glazed timber casement windows to match existing upper floor windows; New conservation roof light to end elevation pitched roof. 2No. flat plateau roof lights to main crown roof and 1No. to new ground floor extension; Chimney stack to be carefully removed; Boiler flue to be carefully removed and external walls made good as required; New timber gate to side alley; Miscellaneous works to the exterior including new sandstone paving to front drive and rear patio; Addition of external wall lights and CCTV cameras."
